{"id":"097d5805c4eeacff","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-df-zfc-tree10-level-preserving-map.md","title":"ZFC Tree10 Level Preserving Map","display":"df-zfc-tree10-level-preserving-map — ZFC Tree10 Level Preserving Map","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-tree10-level-preserving-map","aliases":["58-df-zfc-tree10-level-preserving-map"],"display":"df-zfc-tree10-level-preserving-map — ZFC Tree10 Level Preserving Map","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-zfc-tree10-tree-level-set]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-tree10-level-preserving-map"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-tree10-level-preserving-map</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-tree10-level-preserving-map — ZFC Tree10 Level Preserving Map"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function\">../batch16/58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"48d860d89bef14c5\" href=\"?note=48d860d89bef14c5\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-zfc-tree10-tree-level-set\">../batch05/58-df-zfc-tree10-tree-level-set</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,T,U\\in V\">\\(f,T,U\\in V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}(f,T,U)\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}(f,T,U)\\)</span> is the registered set-function predicate.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\subseteq V\\)</span> is the ordinal predicate from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree10TreeLevelSet}_S(L,T,\\alpha)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree10TreeLevelSet}_S(L,T,\\alpha)\\)</span> is the level-set predicate from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"48d860d89bef14c5\" href=\"?note=48d860d89bef14c5\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-zfc-tree10-tree-level-set\">../batch05/58-df-zfc-tree10-tree-level-set</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree10LevelPreservingMap}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree10LevelPreservingMap}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree10\\text{-}level\\text{-}preserving\\text{-}map}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree10LevelPreservingMap}_S(f,T,U)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,T,U)\n\\land\n\\forall\\alpha\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\to\\exists L_T,L_U\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree10TreeLevelSet}_S(L_T,T,\\alpha)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree10TreeLevelSet}_S(L_U,U,\\alpha)\n\\land\nf[L_T]\\subseteq L_U\n\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree10\\text{-}level\\text{-}preserving\\text{-}map}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree10LevelPreservingMap}_S(f,T,U)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,T,U)\n\\land\n\\forall\\alpha\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\to\\exists L_T,L_U\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree10TreeLevelSet}_S(L_T,T,\\alpha)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree10TreeLevelSet}_S(L_U,U,\\alpha)\n\\land\nf[L_T]\\subseteq L_U\n\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Functionality and both tree structures are enforced through the registered predicates; every source level is mapped into the corresponding target level.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-zfc-tree10-tree-level-set","status":"resolved","id":"48d860d89bef14c5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-zfc-tree10-tree-level-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\subseteq V$ is the ordinal predicate from [[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]].","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-zfc-tree10-tree-level-set","status":"resolved","id":"48d860d89bef14c5","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTree10TreeLevelSet}_S(L,T,\\alpha)$ is the level-set predicate from [[../batch05/58-df-zfc-tree10-tree-level-set]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"f,T,U\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}(f,T,U)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTree10TreeLevelSet}_S(L,T,\\alpha)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTree10LevelPreservingMap}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree10\\text{-}level\\text{-}preserving\\text{-}map}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree10LevelPreservingMap}_S(f,T,U)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,T,U)\n\\land\n\\forall\\alpha\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\to\\exists L_T,L_U\\;\n\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree10TreeLevelSet}_S(L_T,T,\\alpha)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree10TreeLevelSet}_S(L_U,U,\\alpha)\n\\land\nf[L_T]\\subseteq L_U\n\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1486,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3767","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-tree10-level-preserving-map.md|58-df-zfc-tree10-level-preserving-map]]（batch14）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","36d7463d215be751","5582a281f15a33c2","48d860d89bef14c5"]}